  "description": "Our MTB Pro Disc WSD Bike is the perfect fit for female riders looking for a versatile off-road performer suitable for a wide range of terrain. Tailored to perform better for the female rider, go where you want on your terms with this confidence-inspiring bike.\nThe MTB Pro Disc WSD is the first of our new generation of Women Specific Design (WSD) Mountain Bikes and is the perfect fit for female riders looking for a versatile off-road performer. It is suitable for a wide range of terrain including forest trails, river paths, fire roads and singletrack riding.\nWe’ve designed a more compact frame and fitted a shorter stem that better suits average female proportions and centre of mass. Plus, a narrower handlebar to better suit the female shoulder width and a wider saddle to suit female sit-bones are fitted into this MTB Pro Disc WSD.",
